OFF & BN & 4 & $0.767 \pm 0.024$ & $0.908 \pm 0.026$ & $+$2.2 \\
ON  & LN & 4 & $0.773 \pm 0.027$ & $0.914 \pm 0.049$ & $+$2.8 \\
OFF & LN & 3 & $0.802 \pm 0.024$ & $0.911 \pm 0.018$ & $+$5.7 \\
\addlinespace
---  & Vanilla & 3 & $0.745 \pm 0.024$ & $0.878 \pm 0.032$ & --- \\
